OL,3,CNigel Farage declares 'fairly
OL,4,Cconvincing' victory in Clacton by-
OL,5,Celection
OL,7,FNigel Farage has declared victory in
OL,8,Fthe Clacton by-election, as he said
OL,9,Fthe result was an "overwhelming"
OL,10,Fendorsement of him.
OL,12,FThe Reform UK leader said he had won
OL,13,F"fairly convincingly" as counting was
OL,14,Funder way for the by-election he
OL,15,Fcalled following scrutiny of a #5
OL,16,Fmillion donation from a cryptocurrency
OL,17,Ftycoon.
OL,26,@qD@SOUqD@`O]uD@AOUuD@UO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/20
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
