OL,3,CNigel Farage declares 'fairly
OL,4,Cconvincing' victory in Clacton by-
OL,5,Celection
OL,7,FA record 34 candidates are standing.
OL,8,FSatirical candidate Count Binface
OL,9,Fappears to be Mr Farage's main
OL,10,Fchallenger.
OL,12,FSpeaking to Sky News, Count Binface, a
OL,13,Fcharacter created by Jonathan David
OL,14,FHarvey, referred to the possibility of
OL,15,Fa second by-election in the seat if Mr
OL,16,FFarage is found to have broken
OL,17,FParliamentary rules.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/20
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
