PN,30210
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1786681088
OL,3,CNigel Farage declares 'fairly
OL,4,Cconvincing' victory in Clacton by-
OL,5,Celection
OL,7,F"Whatever the outcome on Friday, this
OL,8,Fstunt has not done that."
OL,10,FThe contest is estimated to have cost
OL,11,Ftaxpayers about #250,000 with the
OL,12,Flongest-ever list of candidates, 34.
OL,14,FActing returning officer for Tendring
OL,15,FDistrict Council Ian Davidson said
OL,16,Fextra staff and resources had been put
OL,17,Fon to deal with the election.
OL,26,@oD@AOUpD@YO]
