OL,3,CNigel Farage declares 'fairly
OL,4,Cconvincing' victory in Clacton by-
OL,5,Celection
OL,7,FPhotographers and TV cameras covering
OL,8,Fthe count have been advised by
OL,9,Fofficials they will need a wide-angle
OL,10,Flens to fit all the candidates into a
OL,11,Fsingle shot.
OL,13,FBefore quitting Westminster, Mr Farage
OL,14,Fwas being investigated by the
OL,15,Fparliamentary standards commissioner
OL,16,FDaniel Greenberg over a #5 million
OL,17,Fgift from cryptocurrency tycoon
OL,18,FChristopher Harborne, which he
OL,19,Freceived before taking his seat in the
OL,20,FCommons.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G11/20
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
