OL,3,CNigel Farage declares 'fairly
OL,4,Cconvincing' victory in Clacton by-
OL,5,Celection
OL,7,FUnder Commons rules, new MPs are
OL,8,Frequired to register any gifts worth
OL,9,Fmore than #300 they received in the
OL,10,Fprevious 12 months, except where the
OL,11,Fgift "could not be reasonably thought
OL,12,Fby others" to relate to their
OL,13,Fpolitical activities.
OL,15,FThat investigation was paused when Mr
OL,16,FFarage resigned his seat but will
OL,17,Fresume if he wins the by-election ` as
OL,18,Fbookmakers have made him the firm
OL,19,Ffavourite to do.
OL,26,@sD@FOUtD@JO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G12/20
