OL,3,CNigel Farage declares 'fairly
OL,4,Cconvincing' victory in Clacton by-
OL,5,Celection
OL,7,FMr Farage could also face an
OL,8,Finvestigation over support provided by
OL,9,FGeorge Cottrell, a long-term ally.
OL,11,FMr Cottrell reportedly recruited and
OL,12,Fpaid three staff to work on Mr
OL,13,FFarage's social media before the
OL,14,Fgeneral election, and has continued to
OL,15,Fallow him to use a five-storey,
OL,16,FGeorgian property he rented near
OL,17,FBuckingham Palace.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G13/20
