OL,3,CNigel Farage declares 'fairly
OL,4,Cconvincing' victory in Clacton by-
OL,5,Celection
OL,7,FThe main Westminster parties refused
OL,8,Fto take part in this contest but could
OL,9,Fstand if the outcome of the standards
OL,10,Finvestigation into Mr Farage results
OL,11,Fin another by-election.
OL,13,FIf he is found to have broken the
OL,14,Frules and a suspension of more than 10
OL,15,Fdays is imposed, it could trigger a
OL,16,Frecall petition and the prospect of Mr
OL,17,FFarage losing his seat, forcing a
OL,18,Fsecond contest.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G14/20
