OL,4,Cconvincing' victory in Clacton by-
OL,5,Celection
OL,7,FIn the 2024 general election, Mr
OL,8,FFarage won Clacton with 46.2% of the
OL,9,Fvote and a majority of 8,405 over his
OL,10,FConservative rival.
OL,12,FThe candidates for the Clacton
OL,13,Fconstituency are:
OL,15,F` Joseph 77 (Independent)
OL,17,F` Adham Alkhatip (The Forward Party)
OL,19,F` Count Binface (Count Binface Party)
